{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islantiles is a cozy roguelike deckbuilder where players craft, combine and strategize their way to success! Starting with a single island, you\u2019ll gradually expand your settlement into a thriving town. As you settle a chain of beautiful islands, you\u2019ll unlock, swap, and combine powerful technologies that reshape your entire strategy. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/181dfd51ea1e4b763e09aefcbc307c2e.poster.avif?t=1773226351\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/181dfd51ea1e4b763e09aefcbc307c2e.webm?t=1773226351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, gather resources, shape your deck and trigger satisfying card combos. Technologies don\u2019t just improve your deck \u2013 they twist the core rules, changing how tiles interact, how you score and what kind of strategies you can build. Buy new technologies or sell old ones to adapt to special challenges and pivot your strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/27325e5c678e8d5ee585f6f48497af02.poster.avif?t=1773226351\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/27325e5c678e8d5ee585f6f48497af02.webm?t=1773226351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every island is unique, and no two runs are the same. Master the art of cozy efficiency and grow your settlements to glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Islantiles offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of city puzzler and deck builder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy but compelling roguelike gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and refine different strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different difficulty settings\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 hand-crafted islands to develop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 technologies, each with unique rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highscores &amp; Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression: no two runs are the same</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/505e0ea2b13035d674d0a828096ff74d.poster.avif?t=1773226351\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/extras/505e0ea2b13035d674d0a828096ff74d.webm?t=1773226351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634010?t=1773226351","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/8efcb4e6825f50d7532556a1b2309155c2df096a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773226351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/675f5e21878ddd705603ac2ba01457381441a0f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773226351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634010/675f5e21878ddd705603ac2ba01457381441a0f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773226351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4004880,